    "problemNumber": 8,
    "category": "Geometry",
    "subcategory": "Area",
    "difficulty": 2,
    "statement": "In trapezoid ABCD, AD is perpendicular to DC, AD = AB = 3, and DC = 6. In addition, E is on DC, and BE is parallel to AD. Find the area of triangle BEC.",
