    "problemNumber": 21,
    "category": "Number Theory",
    "subcategory": "Digit divisibility",
    "difficulty": 4,
    "statement": "The 7-digit numbers 74A52B1 and 326AB4C are each multiples of 3. Which of the following could be the value of C?",
